OL,3,GNEWSAWoman rescued after getting
OL,4,Atrapped in beach mud
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman had to be rescued after getting
OL,7,Fstuck in mud on a beach.
OL,9,FHM Crosby Coastguard and Wirral
OL,10,FCoastguard Rescue Team were called to
OL,11,Fthe incident at Crosby Beach on
OL,12,FMerseyside at about 12:50 BST on
OL,13,FSunday.
OL,15,FThey found the woman stuck knee-deep in
OL,16,Fthe mud and unable to free herself.
OL,18,FThe crew recovered the woman using
OL,19,Fspecialist equipment and carried out a
OL,20,Fmedical assessments to make sure the
OL,21,Fwoman was not injured.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
